    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14288" root="رأس" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَأْسٌ مِرْأَسٌ</span></b> , incorrectly written in the K <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرْأَسٌ</span>,
like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَقْعَدٌ</span>, (TA,) <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِصَكٌّ لِلرُّؤُوسِ</span> [app. meaning
<i>A head strong to butt,</i> or <i>knock, against other
heads</i>]: pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُؤُوسٌ مَرَائِيسُ</span>, (K, TA,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرَائِسُ</span>;
(CK;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُؤُوسٌ رُؤَّسٌ</span></b>  [signifies the same].
(K, * TA.)

